EnOcean Equipment Profiles (EEP)
--------------------------------
The standard EEP codecs in custom_components/enocean_eltako/protocol/eep/std/
are generated from the EnOcean Equipment Profiles published by the EnOcean
Alliance (https://www.enocean-alliance.org). They contain technical facts only
(bit positions, scaling, value tables); no specification text is reproduced.
The official XML, PDF and test files are not part of this repository.

According to the EnOcean Alliance, the EEP specification and definitions are
free of charge for non-commercial purposes. Using them in the development of a
product or service for sale requires membership in the EnOcean Alliance and/or
joint ownership of the relevant IPR. If you use this code commercially, check
these terms with the EnOcean Alliance yourself. The MIT License of this
repository does not grant any rights to the EnOcean Alliance's specifications.

Eltako telegram formats
-----------------------
Eltako-specific telegram layouts are implemented from Eltako's public document
"Inhalte der Eltako-Funktelegramme" and device manuals. No text from these
documents is reproduced.

